const bestFriend = new person.friend();
```

:::

Examples of additional **correct** code for this rule with the `{ "newIsCapExceptionPattern": "\\.bar$" }` option:

::: correct

```js
/*eslint new-cap: ["error", { "newIsCapExceptionPattern": "\\.bar$" }]*/

